        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> but can't say if `path:gsub('([&|<>^])', '^%1')` is good way\n\nIdeally `shellescape()` could be used, but AFAIR it only double-quotes stuff and doesn't insert `^` carets. Plus it would need a new `shell` parameter to avoid needing to set-and-restore the global 'shell' option.\n\nI think gsub() is fine.",
